  "body": "### Bug Fixes\n\n* **config:** capture the template cache before a segment goes async ([cf477a5](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/cf477a518f94a6b887f4a5732af44a2263d36019))\n* **config:** keep a running segment's flags out of the render ([5e8e203](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/5e8e203b42dcd4cb6a733b3e40a5a1970a1739e9))\n* **path:** keep template delimiters in folder names literal ([161315a](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/161315a4eff2dcfe590a458cba59558638338b30))\n* **streaming:** own the render lifecycle in the producer ([fb33d39](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/fb33d39ff4ffd9ca797a9ef0a6f095134c325b1b))\n* **template:** close the markup gaps the review found ([04c5ede](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/04c5ede0b03443c46d2b3c860ce836b6ef4091bb))\n* **template:** escape chevrons in rendered action output ([1f3624a](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/1f3624a9df9086e610d78e0205deada9b42188e8))\n* **template:** keep markup trust through recorded data files ([d2673d1](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/d2673d129096e2d1c2db4312ed968cc10342c465))\n* **terminal:** strip control runes from console titles ([9a032ce](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/9a032ceec1aa26299bb8473d4ba75f133c20b920))\n* **terminal:** strip raw C1 bytes from console titles ([1e534e1](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/1e534e1cd0a3d360c2538488c2a224d4e0070511))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **template:** let every function accept markup values ([e2024d2](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/e2024d26d90e8f554e4d91c2a532416a949e170e))",
